<title>GREECE: GREEK REVENUES FROM PROPO FLAT, PROTO DOWN IN JAN-JUNE.</title>
<headline>GREEK REVENUES FROM PROPO FLAT, PROTO DOWN IN JAN-JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek revenues from PROPO gambling game rose slighlty 0.4 percent year-on-year in the period January-June but revenues from the PROTO game fell 15.6 percent year-on-year in the same period, the National Statistics Service said in a statement.</p>
<p>The state collected 20.9 billion drachmas from PROPO in January-June compared to 20.8 billion in the same period and 8.4 billion drachmas from PROTO against 9.99 billion a year earlier, it said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
